PM5 (net031 net052 VDD VDD) mp18 w=1.977e-05 l=7.876e-07 m=23 //// *Input* *gm2*
PM4 (net050 net050 VDD VDD) mp18 w=1.982e-05 l=1.642e-06 m=28 //// *Load* *gm1* ``PM3``
